## 🎬 SCREENWRITER TOOLKIT - Reality Fusion Edition

### 📊 GOLDEN RATIO CALCULATOR SYSTEM

```
EPISODE RUNTIME: 50 minutes (3,000 seconds)

GOLDEN RATIO BREAKPOINTS:
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

ACT 1 (Setup): 0:00 - 18:30 (1,110 sec / 37%)
├─ Hook: 0:00 - 2:00 (120 sec) - MUST GRAB
├─ Inciting Incident: 11:26 (686 sec / 38.2% of Act 1)
└─ Plot Point 1: 18:30 (1,110 sec) - EXIT ACT 1

ACT 2A (Rising Action): 18:30 - 30:54 (745 sec / 24.8%)
├─ Complications build
└─ Midpoint: 30:54 (1,855 sec / 61.8% total) - BIG SHIFT

ACT 2B (Escalation): 30:54 - 41:18 (624 sec / 20.8%)
├─ Stakes raise
├─ False victory/defeat
└─ Plot Point 2: 41:18 (2,479 sec) - DARKEST HOUR

ACT 3 (Resolution): 41:18 - 50:00 (521 sec / 17.4%)
├─ Climax: 45:24 (2,724 sec / 90.8% total)
├─ Resolution: 48:00
└─ Cliffhanger/Setup: 49:30 (if not finale)

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
FIBONACCI SEQUENCE BEATS (ช่วงสำคัญ):
- 3 min mark: First reveal
- 5 min mark: Character depth moment
- 8 min mark: Subplot introduction
- 13 min mark: Relationship shift
- 21 min mark: Major revelation
- 34 min mark: Point of no return
```

