Act 1 = 0.382 (38.2%)
Act 2 = 0.618 (61.8%)
  ├─ Act 2A = 0.382 of Act 2 (23.6% total)
  └─ Act 2B = 0.618 of Act 2 (38.2% total)
Act 3 = 0.236 (23.6%) - OR shorter if cliffhanger
```

